Sure! Those coordinates point to the **Googleplex** (Google’s headquarters) in Mountain View, California.

If you want to verify or retrieve additional information about that location using the Google Maps Geocoding API, you would make a request like this:

```
GET https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/geocode/json?latlng=37.4224764,-122.0842499&key=YOUR_API_KEY
```

Replace `YOUR_API_KEY` with your actual Google Maps API key.

### Example Response

```json
{
   "results" : [
      {
         "address_components" : [
            {
