```

From this JSON you can extract:
- `formatted_address`: “1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043, USA”
- `place_id`: “ChIJj61dQgK6j4AR4Z7l8YfXcEw”
- `geometry.location.lat` and `geometry.location.lng` (which will match the values you supplied)

Feel free to replace the latitude/longitude pair in the URL with any other coordinates you’re interested in, and the API will return the corresponding address components and place ID.
